SLSA specification, by the SLSA Working Group (OpenSSF)
-------------------------------------------------------

src/slsa/schema/spec/ holds a copy of the SLSA specification: Supply-chain
Levels for Software Artifacts, the Working Draft as of version 1.2,
retrieved from
https://github.com/slsa-framework/slsa/tree/v1.2/docs/spec/draft

Its pages, images and provenance schemas are the work of the SLSA Working
Group (https://slsa.dev). Content contributed after the group adopted the
Community Specification governance model is licensed under the Community
Specification License 1.0:
https://github.com/slsa-framework/slsa/blob/main/LICENSE.md
Pre-existing portions from contributors who have not since contributed
under that license are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Every file is identical to its counterpart in docs/spec/draft/ at tag v1.2
(commit 19e4e2f005f871270c4f555fc47afecfb37f3efe), and the copy holds
nothing else.

src/slsa/schema/*.yaml, src/slsa/datamodel/, project/ and the
slsa-linkml package model the specification's tracks, levels and
attestation formats in LinkML. They are this project's rendering, not an
official SLSA release, and their use does not imply endorsement by the
SLSA Working Group or OpenSSF.

