Knowledge bundle
----------------

This product maintains its documentation as a Linked Open Knowledge Format
(LOKF) bundle under .lokf/: https://lokf.nolan-nichols.com/specification/

LOKF is a semantic profile of the Open Knowledge Format (OKF) specification
by Google Cloud Platform:
https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/open-knowledge-format/blob/main/SPEC.md

The scripts under .lokf/scripts/ and .lokf/m365/ and the four
knowledge-*.yaml workflows under .github/workflows/ are copies of the
ktl-sidecar templates in knowledge-trust-ladder
(https://github.com/noelmcloughlin/knowledge-trust-ladder), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.
